&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 82.53333333333333333333333333px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p class="text_align_justify" style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px"&gt;議決権の&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="text_align_justify" style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px"&gt;所有又は&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="text_align_justify" style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px"&gt;被所有割合&lt;/p&gt;
